ails**, and its rewards rules treat participating restaurants, bars, lounges, and nightclubs as eligible F&B outlets. citeturn273493search2turn273493search0\n\nThe part I’d keep separate is **gratuity**. MGM explicitly excludes gratuities from these kinds of credits/vouchers, so your instinct is right: **tip in cash** if you want the folio clean. citeturn273493search1\n\nSo operationally:\n\n- Eat/drink at an **eligible MGM outlet**\n- Charge the food + beer to the room so the **resort/F&B credit** can apply\n- Pay **tip in cash**\n- Avoid random non-eligible room charges\n\nThat should keep the folio clean while still letting the credit cover a beer with dinner.", "text_chars": 963, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "13bd7d8c-cdb0-4841-ab09-bcd66742049d", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789741745.707447, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "thoughts", "part_kinds": [], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "1cba1e08-d6df-4a6d-b102-0dc041f775e9", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789741745.711117, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "reasoning_recap", "part_kinds": [], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "a4384d99-cb9a-48d1-9413-11d95e4bafad", "role": "user", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789741763.382166, "updated_at": 1789741776.146594, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "Yeah, because we can't afford to put anything on that folio, not even a dollar.", "text_chars": 79, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": null, "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "1acff064-adf1-400d-a96f-7985cc4732d3", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789741765.108801, "updated_at": 1789741774.21677, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "Exactly. Then the operating rule for Luxor is **zero post-credit folio balance**.\n\nUse the **$300 resort credit only at confirmed eligible outlets**, keep a running tally before each meal/drink, and **tip in cash**. No minibar, market, retail, room service fee surprises, or anything else that can leave even a small residual charge.\n\nIf you have a beer, fine — but only after the outlet confirms it applies to the resort credit. We do not assume. The goal is checkout with a **$0 folio**, because right now even a small charge can muddy the hold-release timing.", "text_chars": 562, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "21a89c8f-e3cc-4454-a02a-1727942d2c7c", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789741768.607466, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "reasoning_recap", "part_kinds": [], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "fdd7e140-9c3d-4a3e-9b97-716e195c713e", "role": "user", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789741790.450649, "updated_at": 1789741809.258005, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "We'll go ahead and search Luxor, Excalibur, MGM restaurants that take the resort credits so we're prepared.", "text_chars": 107, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": null, "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "f05750f5-5eb9-4a12-9997-7364d0659f2f", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789741791.758472, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "web.run", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": ["text"]}, {"message_id": "bfd65f31-7ceb-4d76-a095-4feb5d2487b1", "role": "tool", "role_name": "web.run", "created_at": 1789741794.8453193, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": ["text"]}, {"message_id": "ae1b68e1-dfc3-4d88-b5d5-de1cd4d3aa8e", "role": "tool", "role_name": "web.run", "created_at": 1789741794.8481307, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": ["text"]}, {"message_id": "69f25a34-bb41-4e3e-92f6-efe0c7f835e6", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789741796.795097, "updated_at": 1789741808.141807, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "Yep — I checked MGM’s current participating dining information so we can build a **safe list** instead of guessing.\n\nFor **Luxor**, the strongest confirmed options are **Diablo’s Cantina, Pyramid Café, Public House, Backstage Deli, TENDER Steakhouse**, plus several bars/lounges such as **Aurora, Centra, Big Chill, TENDER Lounge**, and Starbucks locations. MGM lists those as participating food-and-beverage outlets, and MGM’s own current dining package also specifically names Diablo’s, Pyramid Café, Public House, and Backstage Deli. citeturn783927search0turn783927search7\n\nFor **Excalibur**, the safest confirmed choices are **The Buffet at Excalibur** and **TAP Sports Bar**. MGM’s current package explicitly names both, and both are shown as MGM Rewards-eligible dining outlets. citeturn783927search4turn783927search5turn783927search7\n\nFor **MGM Grand**, the current MGM package specifically names **MGM Grand Buffet** and **TAP Sports Bar** as participating venues. citeturn783927search7\n\nThe rule I’d use while you’re there is simple: **ask the server before ordering, “Will this charge apply against my resort/F&B credit if I charge it to the room?”** MGM itself says participating outlets can be identified by the “Earn & Redeem Here” sign or by asking staff/MGM Rewards. citeturn783927search3\n\nAnd for us, the zero-folio rule stays hard: **food + eligible beer/drink to the room, cash tip, and no charge unless the outlet confirms the credit applies.** MGM excludes gratuities from eligible spend, so cash tips are the cleanest way to keep the folio at zero. citeturn783927search3\n\nIf you want, I can next turn this into a **$300 Luxor food-credit game plan for Fri–Mon** so we know exactly where to eat and roughly how much credit to burn each day.", "text_chars": 1778, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "e8c70759-2fc5-42c3-80b0-a37f7beac6bd", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789741799.911034, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "thoughts", "part_kinds": [], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "abb72916-86bc-415a-b321-84f55bcba616", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789741799.914078, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "reasoning_recap", "part_kinds": [], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "c4423186-9233-40d8-8d10-3672c771deb9", "role": "user", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789741841.867807, "updated_at": 1789741855.972222, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "Yeah, that's perfect, because I already ordered at Diablo's. I can go to the kiosk, order it, make sure it goes where it's gotta go. And especially if I order to go, I can give them a couple bucks at the bar.", "text_chars": 208, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": null, "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "bf72f081-264f-41b5-a582-3798a17b9394", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789741845.431777, "updated_at": 1789741855.399712, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "Exactly. **Diablo’s to-go is almost ideal for the clean-folio strategy.**\n\nUse the kiosk, charge the eligible food/drink against the resort credit, and then hand the bartender or pickup person **a couple bucks cash**. That keeps gratuity completely off the room account.\n\nSo for Luxor this weekend, the operating pattern is basically:\n\n**eligible outlet → confirm credit → charge only covered F&B → cash tip → verify folio stays at $0.**\n\nThat gives you food coverage without contaminating the hold-release cycle.", "text_chars": 513, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "2a209f4e-d88e-47e4-81e2-7b4fe87ea4d7", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789741850.483899, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "reasoning_recap", "part_kinds": [], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "9f4a8713-fafc-41ae-8d26-d606d6fcbfbc", "role": "user", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789742003.554634, "updated_at": 1789742018.396702, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "Also room service is fine. As long as they don't tip extra, it's all included.", "text_chars": 78, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": null, "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "3de02bbb-368c-4c03-8745-84abae203140", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789742004.771817, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "web.run", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_refere