ng expectation from observed MGM behavior:\n  - checkout Monday\n  - **$150 hold likely available Tuesday morning**\n\nCurrent Luxor resort-credit ledger:\n\n- Diablo’s: **$82.37**\n- Backstage Deli: **$23.84**\n- Backstage Deli: **$41.18**\n- Ribs/order: **$68.82**\n- Pyramid Café: **$29.26**\n\nTotal used: **$245.47**\n\nRemaining: **$54.53**\n\nUse remaining credit before Monday checkout if useful. No need to spend cash on food unnecessarily.\n\n---\n\n### Monday bridge — Sept. 21\n\nThe prior multi-night Excalibur reservation is being split.\n\nPlan:\n\n**Monday Sept. 21 → Tuesday Sept. 22**\n- Book **one night at Excalibur**\n- Current rate shown: **$8 room**\n- Estimate with tax: roughly **$10**\n- Hold: **$50**\n- Front-end requirement: roughly **$60**\n- Current checking: **$61**\n\nThis consumes essentially the whole current checking balance but bridges lodging safely until Luxor’s $150 returns.\n\nKeep Monday Excalibur folio completely clean.\n\n---\n\n### Tuesday/Wednesday Excalibur block\n\nExisting Excalibur reservation will be moved to:\n\n**Tuesday Sept. 22 → Thursday Sept. 24**\n\nKnown economics:\n\n- About **$8 already prepaid**\n- About **$8 additional room balance expected**\n- Hold: **$100 total** for two nights\n- Tuesday funding requirement: approximately **$108**\n\nPrimary funding source:\n\n**Luxor $150 hold expected back Tuesday**\n\nSo:\n\n$150 Luxor release  \n− $108 Excalibur Tuesday funding  \n= **~$42 residual**\n\nThis is the core reason for splitting Monday from Tuesday.\n\n---\n\n### Sept. 23–24 cash injections\n\n**Unemployment**\n- File Tuesday Sept. 22\n- Expected Wednesday Sept. 23\n- Amount: **$275**, not $250\n\n**Chinny**\n- Expected by Thursday Sept. 24\n- Amount: **$250**\n- Of that:\n  - **$50 earmarked for Beppi / diapers for my son**\n  - **$200 remains Vegas liquidity**\n\nDo not spend these before they post.\n\n---\n\n## Canonical Hotel Schedule\n\nTreat this as the baseline unless explicitly changed.\n\n| Dates | Hotel | Hold | Resort Credit | Free Play |\n|---|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| Now → 9/21 | Luxor | **$150 already locked** | **$300** | — |\n| 9/21 → 9/22 | Excalibur one-night bridge | **$50** | — | — |\n| 9/22 → 9/24 | Excalibur | **$100** | — | — |\n| 9/24 → 9/28 | **Luxor King Suite** replacing Vdara | **~$200** | **$300** | TBD / do not count |\n| 9/28 → 10/1 | Excalibur | **$150** | — | — |\n| 10/1 → 10/5 | NY-NY | **$300** | **$300** | **$270 confirmed** |\n| 10/5 → 10/8 | Excalibur | **$150** | — | — |\n| 10/8 → 10/12 | MGM Grand | **$400** | **$300** | — |\n| 10/12 → 10/15 | Fontainebleau | **$450** | — | — |\n| 10/15 | Paycheck checkpoint | — | — | — |\n\n### Important change\n\n**Vdara Sept. 24 is being replaced by Luxor King Suite**, subject to final confirmation.\n\nOld:\n- Vdara hold **$400**\n- Resort credit **$150**\n\nNew:\n- Luxor hold about **$200**\n- Resort credit **$300**\n\nNet near-term improvement:\n\n- **$200 less cash locked**\n- **$150 more food value**\n\nThis is now the preferred move.\n\n---\n\n## Hold-release pattern / empirical rule\n\nObserved MGM clean-folio behavior:\n\n- Excalibur clean checkout Friday → hold was back by Saturday morning\n- Prior clean Luxor stay also released rapidly\n- Therefore current working planning assumption:\n  - Monday Luxor checkout → **$150 likely Tuesday morning**\n  - Never treat as cash until actually posted\n\nOld Excalibur **$55.55 ghost hold** finally cleared. That issue is CLOSED.\n\n---\n\n## Promo-value schedule\n\nKnown future non-cash value:\n\n**Sept. 24 Luxor**\n- $300 resort credit\n\n**Oct. 1 NY-NY**\n- $300 resort credit\n- $270 free play\n\n**Oct. 8 MGM Grand**\n- $300 resort credit\n\nKnown future MGM resort-credit value from Sept. 24 through Oct. 12:\n\n**$900**\n\nDo not count resort credit as cash.\n\nFree play remains **$0 cash until converted**.\n\n---\n\n## Cash-flow outlook\n\nThe hotel/liquidity bridge is now broadly viable through **Oct. 8**.\n\nThe main future pressure point remains