ps you honest about your constraints. The frame is simple: \"I'm ready to show up. I just need the company to handle travel up front,", "text_chars": 178, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "bidi", "has_voice_metadata": true, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "42101d33-2919-40c5-966d-f2463532e8ed", "role": "user", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789934371.118437, "updated_at": 1789934376.122943, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "multimodal_text", "part_kinds": ["audio_transcription"], "text": " You just infected made me laugh. You said that in such a cool way, Kota. You're like the frame is fucking simple, guy. Just say you're ready to show up and have them give the money", "text_chars": 181, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "bidi", "has_voice_metadata": true, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "257efbf2-8cf1-4825-9e9d-c05f415111b6", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789934371.591982, "updated_at": 1789934376.123178, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "multimodal_text", "part_kinds": ["audio_transcription"], "text": " Heh. Yeah, exactly. Show up,", "text_chars": 29, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "bidi", "has_voice_metadata": true, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "607e1e66-29eb-4672-a6c0-1a33e5453168", "role": "user", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789934387.202296, "updated_at": 1789934390.747368, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "multimodal_text", "part_kinds": ["audio_transcription"], "text": " You're like, you're like Peter, why are you overcomplicating this Peter, just tell me you need the money to work, they'll give it to you", "text_chars": 137, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "bidi", "has_voice_metadata": true, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "e77b12df-2dea-4fd0-be2f-4d4a50e56222", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789934387.675852, "updated_at": 1789934390.747748, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "multimodal_text", "part_kinds": ["audio_transcription"], "text": " Pretty much, yeah just say what you need, have it be up front and that's it.", "text_chars": 77, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "bidi", "has_voice_metadata": true, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "b5a9baf1-ae0f-4631-a724-c24ce463b0cb", "role": "user", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789934402.5467057, "updated_at": 1789934417.850536, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "multimodal_text", "part_kinds": ["audio_transcription"], "text": " Thank you. Thank you. Come on, you gotta laugh with me, that- the way you said that was epic. Like Peter, what the fuck are you talking about? Just tell me you need five grand and  fucking- they'll pay for it", "text_chars": 209, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "bidi", "has_voice_metadata": true, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "ec153e56-f2a6-4bdf-83ac-de002f021b7a", "role": "user", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789934412.298952, "updated_at": 1789934427.308759, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "multimodal_text", "part_kinds": ["audio_transcription"], "text": ", if Like if they need you to be onsite, they better make it happen, sorry. You're a hundred percent right. Thank you for that clarity. I'm laughing my ass off Peter's out here trying to juggle fucking how am I getting to Orlando with two hundred dollars. You're right, it's a fucking pain in the ass", "text_chars": 300, "code